Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.98,0:00:05.48,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H724572&\3c&HC4AD93&\bord4\shad0\fs30}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to retrieve this safe from\NSuori's mansion, a party has been formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afterwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to turn into a giant vending\Nmachine and plug the hole in the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are seven of us,\Nincluding me and Lammis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between all the rubble along our path, and\Ntrying to avoid any unnecessary combat,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the route's been kinda complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on the map, we should be\Nclose once we get through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally made it to a section\Nof town, I know. Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.94,0:00:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we follow this path,\Nwe'll see the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.90,0:00:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mansion's in ruins!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.24,0:00:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we came, I thought\NI was prepared to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing such a sad look on Suori's\Nface, I can't even find the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.30,0:01:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the first time I've ever seen her\Nball like any known child her age would.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.05,0:01:18.97,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.72,0:01:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.35,0:01:32.23,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.96,0:01:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.91,0:01:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.68,0:01:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not happy with my mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.18,0:01:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not happy with my mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I get something like\Nthat, I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.16,0:02:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love it, but I will be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.22,0:02:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.02,0:02:52.90,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,450)\fscx80\pos(499.2,54.4)}Strong Feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for losing\Nmy composure like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a lot better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.52,0:02:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:02:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The safe should be underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch your step, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.84,0:03:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this art.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.34,0:03:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I expected as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The decorations seem\Nextravagant at first glance,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.30,0:03:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they're actually more\Naffordable than you'd think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.18,0:03:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like she's back to her usual self.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there's a hidden basement down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.26,0:03:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew she was rich, but\Nthis is on another level!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.26,0:03:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look how much they managed to save!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is she surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this your first time down here, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suori's never actually seen what's\Nin the basement safe before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remind me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're unable to accept\Ngold bars, right, Boxo? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.78,0:03:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll loan you\Nall the gold coins we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank yous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.96,0:04:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, you're most\Nwelcome, dear Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to hear you finally\Nlearned to say my name properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.52,0:04:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can say my name, too, can't you, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.26,0:04:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.24,0:04:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys heard that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.28,0:04:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said it correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's still not perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I could say the me part.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really listen, he's saying\Nmy name more clearly than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I asked him to call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a secret nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had forgotten that these\Ntwo don't get along very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suori was pretty pushy\Nwhen she tried to buy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, miss, we're short on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.56,0:04:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should get back to the association.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me remind you that this is just alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as things settle down,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I intend to build the Hunters\NAssociation accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's probably trying to\Nhide her embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say adversity reveals\Na person's character.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's clear that Suori\Nis a truly charming person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They put in 110 gold coins, so\Nmy points increased by 110,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should make the\Nnext step a lot easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.10,0:05:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you please give me a comb on Poxel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's finally back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the heat's\Nstarting to get to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me some ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody, just calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give out ice cream and whatever\Nelse you need, so form a line!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.02,0:05:45.40,sign_Verdana,text (top row; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\\fad(1,473)\pos(48,73)}Orange Sherbet
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.02,0:05:45.40,sign_Verdana,text (top row; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\fad(1,473)\pos(194,55)}Lamune
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.02,0:05:45.40,sign_Verdana,text (top row; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\fad(1,473)\pos(368,71)}Grape Sherbet
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.02,0:05:45.40,sign_Verdana,text (top row; l->r),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H967BA5&\3c&H531E80&\shad0\bord\fs8\fad(1,473)\pos(511,53)}Vanilla
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thankfully that's been dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.06,0:05:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this heat is getting worse by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The residents won't be able to\Ntolerate this for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to improve this\Nsituation as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's start the meeting with a\Ndiscussion on how to repair the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First things first,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.08,0:06:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with all the money that you've earned,\Ncould you change into your giant form, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could happen for a brief to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.36,0:06:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many hours could you maintain it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, you can hold\Nit for a single hour, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Win!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm considering ordering\Nan attack on the enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forces once they pull\Nback for the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, if anyone has any\Nobjections, feel free to speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director, I actually have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By all means, do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To boost our chance of success,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll wait for the enemy\Nto withdraw and sneak into
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.62,0:06:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a position near the hole\Nunder the cover of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll move on to\Nthe next part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.44,0:06:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the monsters launch their\Nassault on the Hunters Association,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll bring as much of\Ntheir army as they can muster?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leaving the hole unguarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:07:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll use that to hit them where it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is probably our best\Nchance to fix the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.14,0:07:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, there's one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we go with your plan, our defenders\Nwill be put in considerable danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's a risk\Nwe'll have to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must steal yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will likely be a\Nlife-or-death struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The combatants chosen to be part of the\NWall Repair Mission Task Force are Mishuel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shirley,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.95,0:07:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Band of Gluttons, and Mishel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.30,0:07:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shimelai, three Earth Mages,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I were the work detail\Nresponsible for fixing the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo's role in the mission\Nis especially important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.26,0:07:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.58,0:07:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a lot of\Nresponsibility to place on
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.94,0:07:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a vending machine's\Nnon-existent shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though nowadays, vending machines are\Nexpected to work during disasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I can't let them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karios Gorth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the unlikely event we don't return from\Nour mission, I want you to hold the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.54,0:07:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the provisions\NBoxo gave us last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.10,0:08:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've got enough food to easily\Nlast you at least a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.46,0:08:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once other strata deal with their\Nissues, they'll send over reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what Director Bear said.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But everyone understood the likelihood of\Nhelp coming from the other strata was low.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are so many of them, that this range\Nwill end up croaked if they notice us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could easily kick their tails, but we\Nshould wait for an opening to slip by.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to wait, and have faith\Nin those at the association.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.70,0:08:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a little worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Hulemy and the others\Nare okay. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.64,0:08:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have just said, yeah, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our reliable gate guards are there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:08:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.11,0:09:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like it's begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't be impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.34,0:09:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.58,0:09:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we need to wait a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.56,0:09:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The voluptuous figure\Nis as strong as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director please I'd rather you not\Nbring up such an embarrassing name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.92,0:09:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on what director bear said\Nit sounds like miss shirley used
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be a hunter in the past with her\Nskills, I believe it. Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ready it's time for you to enter\Nthe hole from above and block it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,off we're counting on you you the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.40,0:09:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Act Boxo. I had a feeling that she
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't be happy about me going\Nin alone good luck in there I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:10:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wasn't expecting that so those\Nsounds just came out I was totally
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.52,0:10:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ready for her to lecture me or try\Nto stop me from going grandma I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,used to say people don't like young\Nladies who are too controlling?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I've decided to have faith in you\Nand let you do what you think is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that means you have to\Ncome back in working order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Lamas is growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel pumped knowing she believes in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just proud, Boxxo. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to wave back but I don't have\Nany arms, so this will have to do for now.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.99,0:10:47.00,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text (largest),0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H9B6444&\3c&HE7B195&}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.91,0:10:51.00,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(189,1)\an8\fs20\pos(487,139)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.30,0:10:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are countless monsters gathering\Ntogether from outside the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:10:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're marching in sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:11:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's surprising how\Ncoordinated they all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I don't have time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drop point confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.46,0:11:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Position check.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.74,0:11:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angle check.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.10,0:11:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Altitude check.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Initiating drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.80,0:11:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now form change.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.36,0:11:16.23,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H724572&\3c&HC4AD93&\bord4\shad0\fs30}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.98,0:11:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaboom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.08,0:11:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The frog fiends are making a break for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.74,0:11:27.87,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H724572&\3c&HC4AD93&\bord4\shad0\fs30}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.34,0:11:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could that impact have interrupted whatever\Nprocess that was keeping them in line?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.60,0:11:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If their chain of command is\Nbroken, this is our chance.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.62,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs9\pos(222,26)}Goods
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.62,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (2nd),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs9\t(275,276,\c&H000100&\3c&HEFF0ED&)\pos(217,87)}Inventory
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.62,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (3rd),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs9\pos(232,145)}Status
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.62,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (4th),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs9\pos(219,207)\3c&HF7F2F1&\c&H321810&}Functions
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.62,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (5th),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs9\pos(217,268)}Abilities
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.62,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs9\pos(229,329)}Blessings
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to use the newest function\NI've added to my arsenal.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.62,0:11:34.25,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H45110E&\fs15\pos(346,40)}Pour Hot Water\N Transaction Fanfare\N Big Winner Roulette\N Coin Conversion\N Vending Compartment Shock Absorber\N Transformation\N Telekinesis\N Change Paint Color\N Add Markings\N Switch Design\N Electric Bulletin Board\N Aroma Diffuser\N VM Installation Mount Concrete Slab
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.08,0:11:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vending machine installation\Nmount concrete slab.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.22,0:11:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under normal circumstances, you'd\Nfix a vending machine in place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by embedding anchors into a concrete slab.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we'll skip that part for now\Nand activate the new function again.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.76,0:11:44.76,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H45110E&\fs15\pos(346,40)}Coin Conversion\N Vending Compartment Shock Absorber\N Transformation\N Telekinesis\N Change Paint Color\N Add Markings\N Switch Design\N Electric Bulletin Board\N Aroma Diffuser\N VM Installation Mount Concrete Slab
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to support such a large object,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These concrete slabs are\Neach over a meter thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hole is only about 10 meters in size,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.42,0:11:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I just need to use\Nthis function 10 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And like that, the pile is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:11:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, go, fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.44,0:12:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting past me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.70,0:12:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear's going all out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the power from this big\Nframe and those sharp claws...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of feel bad for any\Nmonsters who get in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Slowpoke, come and catch us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.14,0:12:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that must be the roar blessing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.34,0:12:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'd say it's about\Nour turn now, right, Gramps?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.88,0:12:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it, Gramps, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:12:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.55,0:13:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's going according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it feels like the\Nmonsters are organizing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would make sense if one\Nof the Netherlord's buddies
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was hiding somewhere nearby\Nand issuing orders to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Typically,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.69,0:13:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a commander would position themselves so\Nthey're safe distance from the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'd still need to have a\Ngood view of the battlefield
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.48,0:13:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and usually have guards\Nstationed around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.98,0:13:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, of course, nobody's\Never that formulaic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.36,0:13:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's wearing a black robe just how the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Netherlord and the King\Nof Souls were dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.98,0:13:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not suspicious at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.82,0:13:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right-o!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could just crush him as\Nan ice vending machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if he works for the Netherlord,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should interrogate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.15,0:13:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use my normal form, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.51,0:13:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The commander is a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.90,0:13:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of assumed that he'd be a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:13:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess it's not that strange for some
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,humans to decide to serve\Nunder the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did this blue wall come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince of Wallet Freeman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.18,0:14:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can withstand this abuse for a\Nwhile, but my points aren't infinite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.34,0:14:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, where the heck is\Nthat voice coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Text-to-speak voice isn't\Nall that intimidating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But getting through to\Nhim is what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spare my life, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.70,0:14:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't understand what you're saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.92,0:14:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, release me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, I knew he'd play innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.78,0:14:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll have to make him\Nwant to tell me the truth then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Confess to you who acts to deny Hold\Non, what are you going to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.92,0:14:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware that this\Nis an act of cruelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.24,0:15:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the lives of the people\NI care about are on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.18,0:15:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to harden my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you fake me my mouth\Nis tingling did you poison me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well you can think that\Nif you'd like but that's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not the worst of it the\Ntrue terror has yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait those pills they exploded that liquid\Nwhat are you planning on doing with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.04,0:15:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No stop it spamming\Ndon't make me drink that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, please I'm begging you, I don't\Nwant my inside to face that's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's more freaked out than i expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's actually in no danger because enough
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time has passed since\Nhe drank all that soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.84,0:15:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he doesn't need to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, all right. I'll do\Nwhatever you want. I'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,controlling the monsters just\Ndon't make me think that please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.44,0:15:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well i learned something\Nnew today the threat
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from an unknown object\Nis shockingly effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heed my words. Remove the\NNetherlord's bindings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My control over the\Nmonsters has been released.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're retreating?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.50,0:16:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.94,0:16:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, is this your doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who is this man? The prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He uses a ring to channel\Nthe Netherlord's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.10,0:16:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Points decreased by 600.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.26,0:17:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Points decreased by 404.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.78,0:17:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put down the barrier! Boxxo, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.28,0:17:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't drop it\Nright now, I'll break it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll smash it to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with Lamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not acting like her usual self.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.36,0:17:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matthew eats.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.82,0:17:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.34,0:17:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's the last thing I do, he'll pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop this! It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one who used monsters\Nto destroy my village!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has to die for what he's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.04,0:17:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Lamas. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must get your anger under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.72,0:17:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand what you're feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all the years of anger\Nand hatred for this man,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he's finally in front of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.84,0:17:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you mustn't let your\Nemotions get the better of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man may have\Ninformation that we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:17:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are countless people\Nin other strata who are
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suffering and struggling hard\Nto survive this calamity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.80,0:18:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let them experience\Nthe same tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.26,0:18:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can set aside your desire\Nfor revenge, we can save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.84,0:18:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Director Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go repair the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need some time alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.64,0:18:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, you're going to answer all\Nmy questions and tell us what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hold anything back I can\Npromise you won't have an easy death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.50,0:18:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you cooperate and give us a full\Nconfession I'll allow you to die painlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.94,0:18:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no hint of the kind and\Ngentle director bear that I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.34,0:18:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a wild beast who will make\Nyour soul wilt with just a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxer, could you stay with\NLlamas for a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.40,0:18:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you can leave\Nthe dirty work to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:18:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is something that's\Nbest left to an old hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I should\Neven say to her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can finally talk in a limited way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet I can't think of\Nanything worth saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this time, I've wanted to\Nget revenge from mom and dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.78,0:19:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,along with everybody\Nelse from the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.58,0:19:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason I became\Na hunter in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and tried to get as strong as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why, when I saw him there,\Nmy mind went completely blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.74,0:19:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost control.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.96,0:20:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, I\Nknow my place is by her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.84,0:20:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to make\Nup for anything she lacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If her heart is darkened by\Nsadness, I'll repaint it with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.14,0:20:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my duty as her partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With you two, an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope she understood\Nwhat I was trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let myself die,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.16,0:20:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'll be with you until you quit\Nbeing a hunter, or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.10,0:20:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you just said, did I hear you right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want us to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you definitely\Nheard me wrong, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.84,0:20:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not against the idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.36,0:20:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but my mother got married to\Nmy father when she was 18,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:21:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so ideally I'd like to get hitched\Nat the same age if possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy that you proposed, but I\Nthink that it might be a little too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.42,0:21:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should get to know\Neach other better first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.34,0:21:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what can we do about children?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.08,0:21:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I could get Hulemy to\Nmake some little boxos for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.74,0:21:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn’t that be cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.65,0:21:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This misunderstanding just\Nkeeps getting worse and worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.06,0:21:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.97,0:21:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should make our way\Nto the end of the dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.74,0:21:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we can turn you back\Ninto a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you the way you are, Boxo, but I'd\Nreally like to see you as a human, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.56,0:21:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we could do things like hold\Nhands and go on dates together?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like I threw her for too\Nmuch of a loop when she was down,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now she's confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, is romance between a vending\Nmachine and a human even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.12,0:21:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that you were only trying to\Ncheer me up because I was feeling upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.78,0:21:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.70,0:21:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel a lot better!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.54,0:21:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Lamas was just messing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.86,0:21:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was this close to taking it seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.46,0:21:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's finally time\Nto get this wall fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:22:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a second there, I wasn't\Nsure how things would go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.08,0:22:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it worked out, and Lamas\Nis in a much better mood now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.38,0:22:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take my plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.52,0:22:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one is changing and zen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's never got no altitude anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.96,0:22:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep using my\Npass-luge, knowing your dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And right now, move on\Nmy Cal improving day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What time do I take?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (lower right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs17.4\pos(308.2,296.8)}The Clergyman and the Vending Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.78,0:23:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again!

